    <value>Il tuo portafoglio {} non ha un account con cui firmare. Aggiungi o collega un account nel portafoglio, poi riprova.</value>
    <comment>Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns no_account: the chosen wallet shared no account it can sign with (none is connected to the site, or it holds only accounts of another chain), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="bittensor_error_signature_mismatch" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Questa firma non proviene dall'indirizzo che hai inserito. In {}, firma il messaggio con quell'indirizzo, poi incolla di nuovo la firma.</value>
    <comment>Bittensor wallet connect (Earnings), manual entry (TAO.com, or Talisman on a phone): the server refused the pasted signature because it does not verify for the address the user typed over the shown message (POST /sn/wallet error.code signature_mismatch). Usually the user signed with another account in the wallet. The server cannot tell which account signed. The argument is the wallet product name (TAO.com or Talisman).</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="bittensor_error_user_rejected" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>La richiesta è stata rifiutata nel tuo portafoglio. Ricomincia e approvala per continuare.</value>
    <comment>Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns user_rejected: the user declined the connection or the signature request in the wallet, so nothing was signed. The Bittensor page (Talisman, or a WalletConnect wallet) and the Solana page of the desktop apps (Phantom or Solflare) both return it; on iOS, Phantom and Solflare decline with 4001, which reads the same.</comment>
  </data>
